<Project>

  <!--
    Copy this file to "Horde.local.props" (git-ignored) and set the path below for your machine.

    HordeBinDir must point at a *built* Horde server output directory - the same directory the plugin
    will eventually be dropped into. It contains HordeServer.Build.dll, HordeServer.Shared.dll,
    EpicGames.Horde.dll and friends.

    For a UE source engine that is typically:
      <UE>\Engine\Source\Programs\Horde\HordeServer\bin\Development\net10.0

    Build it first if the directory does not exist yet:
      dotnet build <UE>\Engine\Source\Programs\Horde\Horde.sln -c Development

    Alternatively set the HORDE_BIN_DIR environment variable and skip this file entirely.
  -->
